: R-CD ( t --- )   \ cd DIR
  DUP R-CSTR CHDIR IF ." rill: cd: cannot change to " R-TYPE R-NL 1 R-STATUS ! -4000 THROW THEN DROP ;
VARIABLE CWD-STACK   \ cd DIR { ... }: where to come back to, innermost on top
: R-CWD-PUSH ( --- )
  CWD-STACK @ 0= IF R-NEW-LIST CWD-STACK ! THEN
  4096 R-ALLOT DUP 4096 GETCWD DROP R-TEXT K-TEXT R-BOX CWD-STACK @ R-PUSH ;
: R-CWD-POP ( --- )   CWD-STACK @ DUP R-LEN 1- R-AT R-ANY>TEXT R-CD  -1 CWD-STACK @ +! ;
